\u00e1dn\u00ed \u010dlenov\u00e9 dohromady zaplat\u00ed z\u00e1kladn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek kr\u00e1t jejich po\u010det."],"Payment button (the fees are final)":["Tla\u010d\u00edtko platby (p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky jsou kone\u010dn\u00e9)"],"Turn on once the volunteer hours of the period are closed: members then see their final fee and can pay it. While it is off, the fees are shown as calculated from the hours recorded so far. Leave it off if you do not collect fees through this page.":["Zapn\u011bte, a\u017e budou brig\u00e1dnick\u00e9 hodiny za obdob\u00ed uzav\u0159en\u00e9: \u010dlenov\u00e9 pak uvid\u00ed kone\u010dn\u00fd p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek a mohou ho zaplatit. Dokud je vypnut\u00e9, p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky se zobrazuj\u00ed podle dosud zapsan\u00fdch hodin. Pokud p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky p\u0159es tuto str\u00e1nku nevyb\u00edr\u00e1te, nechte ho vypnut\u00e9."],"Discount for the lowest fees":["Sleva pro nejni\u017e\u0161\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvky"],"Members who volunteered the most pay even less. The discount is not added to the fees of the others.":["Kdo odpracoval nejv\u00edc, zaplat\u00ed je\u0161t\u011b m\u00e9n\u011b. Sleva se nep\u0159i\u010d\u00edt\u00e1 k p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvk\u016fm ostatn\u00edch."],"Calculated fee and discount (when the discount is on)":["Vypo\u010dten\u00fd p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek a sleva (je-li sleva zapnut\u00e1)"],"List honorary members":["Zobrazit \u010destn\u00e9 \u010dleny"],"Period and base fee above the table":["Obdob\u00ed a z\u00e1kladn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edsp\u011bvek nad tabulkou"],"Totals rows at the end of the table":["Sou\u010dtov\u00e9 \u0159\u00e1dky na konci tabulky"],"Highlight the logged-in member":["Zv\u00fdraznit p\u0159ihl\u00e1\u0161en\u00e9ho \u010dlena"]}}}